    {
      "id": "claim_960ef60594054b74b48939f6a0926393",
      "statement": "Brijio is a user-controlled, privacy-first bridge that relays short-lived explicit MCP requests to the user's authenticated browser; the extension connects only after explicit user action, the browser never streams ambient state, and every read or action is initiated by an explicit MCP tool or resource request rather than continuous streaming or background surveillance.",
